   </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      \n      <div class=\"lg:w-[45%] h-[400px] lg:h-auto relative\" data-kid=\"169\">\n        <img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1600790194169-d3affafaf726?auto=format&w=1000&q=80&fit=crop\" alt=\"Fresh Cooking Ingredients\" class=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover\" decoding=\"async\" data-kid=\"170\">\n        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-emerald-950/10 mix-blend-multiply\" data-kid=\"171\"></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  \n  <footer class=\"bg-zinc-950 text-zinc-400 py-24 px-6 border-t border-zinc-800/50\" data-kid=\"172\">\n    <div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto\" data-kid=\"173\">\n      <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-12 mb-16\" data-kid=\"174\">\n        <div class=\"md:col-span-5\" data-kid=\"175\">\n          <div class=\"flex items-center space-x-2 mb-8 group cursor-pointer\" data-kid=\"176\">\n            <div class=\"w-10 h-10 bg-emerald-600 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center text-white shadow-lg transition-transform\" data-kid=\"177\">\n              <i class=\"ti ti-leaf text-2xl\" data-kid=\"178\"></i>\n            </div>\n            <span class=\"font-bold text-3xl tracking-tighter text-white\" data-kid=\"179\">Naya</span>\n          </div>\n          <p class=\"text-zinc-500 text-lg leading-relaxed max-w-sm mb-10\" data-kid=\"180\">\n            Mangez mieux, vivez mieux. Découvrez, partagez et créez des recettes saines qui célèbrent les richesses culinaires.\n          </p>\n          <div class=\"flex items-center space-x-5\" data-kid=\"181\">\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-zinc-800 flex items-center justify-center text-white hover:bg-emerald-600 transition-colors\" data-kid=\"182\">\n              <i class=\"ti ti-brand-instagram text-2xl\" data-kid=\"183\"></i>\n            </a>\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-zinc-800 flex items-center justify-center text-white hover:bg-emer