=\"47\">Végétalien</span>\n      </button>\n    </div>\n  </header>\n\n  \n  <main class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-10 pb-40\" data-kid=\"48\">\n    <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-x-12 gap-y-24\" data-kid=\"49\">\n      \n      \n      <div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-24\" data-kid=\"50\">\n        <article class=\"group cursor-pointer animate-fade-up\" style=\"animation-delay: 0.1s;\" data-kid=\"51\">\n          <div class=\"relative aspect-[4/5] rounded-[2rem] overflow-hidden mb-8 shadow-2xl shadow-zinc-200/50\" data-kid=\"52\">\n            <img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1748540459503-19efc015143b?auto=format&w=800&q=80&fit=crop\" alt=\"Rustic Mediterranean\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-1000 group-hover:scale-110\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-kid=\"53\">\n            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-emerald-950/0 group-hover:bg-emerald-950/30 transition-all duration-700 flex items-center justify-center\" data-kid=\"54\">\n              <span class=\"opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 glass text-emerald-950 px-10 py-4 rounded-2xl font-bold shadow-2xl transition-all translate-y-8 group-hover:translate-y-0 duration-500 border border-white/40\" data-kid=\"55\">Quick View</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"px-2\" data-kid=\"56\">\n            <span class=\"text-emerald-600 font-bold text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.4em]\" data-kid=\"57\">Déjeuner • Méditerranéen</span>\n            <h3 class=\"font-serif text-4xl text-zinc-950 mt-4 leading-[1.15] group-hover:text-emerald-800 transition-colors\" data-kid=\"58\">Rustic Mediterranean Spread with Herbes</h3>\n            <div class=\"flex items-center space-x-6 mt-6 text-zinc-400 font-semibold text-sm\" data-kid=\"59\">\n              <div class=\"flex items-center space-x-2\" data-kid=\"60\"><i class=\"ti ti-clock text-emerald-600 text-lg\" data-kid=\"61\"></i><span data-kid=\"62\">25 min</span></div>\n      