"126\"></i><span data-kid=\"127\">290 kcal</span></div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </article>\n\n        <article class=\"group cursor-pointer animate-fade-up\" style=\"animation-delay: 0.5s;\" data-kid=\"128\">\n          <div class=\"relative aspect-[4/5] rounded-[2rem] overflow-hidden mb-8 shadow-2xl shadow-zinc-200/50\" data-kid=\"129\">\n            <img src=\"https://images.pexels.com/photos/25639529/pexels-photo-25639529.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=800&q=80\" alt=\"Seasonal Harvest\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-1000 group-hover:scale-110\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-kid=\"130\">\n            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-emerald-950/0 group-hover:bg-emerald-950/30 transition-all duration-700 flex items-center justify-center\" data-kid=\"131\">\n              <span class=\"opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 glass text-emerald-950 px-10 py-4 rounded-2xl font-bold shadow-2xl transition-all translate-y-8 group-hover:translate-y-0 duration-500 border border-white/40\" data-kid=\"132\">Quick View</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"px-2\" data-kid=\"133\">\n            <span class=\"text-emerald-600 font-bold text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.4em]\" data-kid=\"134\">Dîner • Équilibre</span>\n            <h3 class=\"font-serif text-4xl text-zinc-950 mt-4 leading-[1.15] group-hover:text-emerald-800 transition-colors\" data-kid=\"135\">Seasonal Harvest Root Veggies</h3>\n            <div class=\"flex items-center space-x-6 mt-6 text-zinc-400 font-semibold text-sm\" data-kid=\"136\">\n              <div class=\"flex items-center space-x-2\" data-kid=\"137\"><i class=\"ti ti-clock text-emerald-600 text-lg\" data-kid=\"138\"></i><span data-kid=\"139\">35 min</span></div>\n              <div class=\"flex items-center space-x-2\" data-kid=\"140\"><i class=\"ti ti-flame text-emerald-600 text-lg\" data-kid=\"141\"></i><span data-kid=\"142\">520 kcal</span></div>\n  